`timescale 1ns / 1ns

//
// Animated Julia-set generator, 1920x1080@60.
//
// Same escape-time iteration as the Mandelbrot project (z <- z^2 + c) and the
// same timing-closed streaming pipeline, but:
//   * z0 = the pixel's complex coordinate (not 0);
//   * c  = a constant that walks a circle  c = 0.7885 * (cos t, sin t),
//     advanced one step every ANIM_DIV frames -> the fractal morphs.
// The iteration count (0..N) maps to colour through a "teal & orange" LUT.
// LUTs (c-circle and palette) are generated by tools/julia_model.py.
//
